This product includes software developed at Raylytics.

Weather data is provided by the U.S. National Weather Service API
(https://www.weather.gov/documentation/services-web-api), a public-domain
U.S. Government service. No API key or account is required.

Weather outside the National Weather Service's coverage, and days eight and
nine of the daily forecast everywhere, are provided by the Norwegian
Meteorological Institute (MET Norway) Locationforecast API
(https://api.met.no), licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Weather data from MET Norway.

The bundled place list combines the U.S. Census Bureau Gazetteer (public
domain) with GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org), licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence. Place data from GeoNames.
